{"key":"character/merc10","relations":[{"id":"person","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/glav","title":"Brother Khatul","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/merc8","title":"Feiruz","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/merc7","title":"Sahilia","variant":""}],"title":"Related characters"},{"id":"model","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"creature/bz2h%20human%20alija%20f","title":"Alia (variant 2)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/bz3h%20human%20sahilja%20f","title":"Sahilia (variant 1)","variant":""}],"title":"In-game models"},{"id":"location","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/bz3h","title":"Last Shelter","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz2h","title":"Rindeil's mansion","variant":""}],"title":"Found in"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Aliya</h1><h2>Biography</h2><p><a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Aliya</a> is Feiruz’s fiancée and a contact of the Last Shelter. After escaping prison and losing him, she leads Kir and Kel to the brotherhood and vouches for them before <a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Brother Khatul</a>. She also asks them to find the missing <a href=\"wiki://character/merc7\">Sahilia</a> and obtain medicine for her recovery. [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original game dialogue and world descriptions. Source numbers refer to the scenes listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Aliya</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_38)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/elder\">Rindeil</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Aliya</a> (briefing brief_40)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Aliya</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Brother Khatul</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_41)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Aliya</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_46)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Aliya</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc7\">Sahilia</a> (briefing brief_47)</td></tr></table><h2>Related characters</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Brother Khatul</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc8\">Feiruz</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc7\">Sahilia</a></td></tr></table><h2>In-game models</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz2h%20human%20alija%20f\">Alia (variant 2)</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz3h%20human%20sahilja%20f\">Sahilia (variant 1)</a></td></tr></table><h2>Found in</h2><p>These locations come from original records. Scripts may move or hide a character.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Related page</th><th>Details</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz3h\">Last Shelter</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz2h\">Rindeil's mansion</a></td><td /></tr></table></article>","id":"","image":"65998fe407f46183d65be6e3","pins":[],"representative_image":false,"title":"Aliya"}]}
